sentences.l:
When early-born appeared, rose-fingered Dawn,
they set out to go to the hunt, both the dogs and also themselves,
the sons of Autolycus;

The Sun then newly was striking the fields
out of gently-flowing, deep-flowing Oceanus,
and they to a glen came, the hunters;

and before them
tracks searching-out the dogs went, but behind
the sons of Autolycus;

It, then, neither of winds did the wet force blow through, of them blowing,
nor did the shining Sun strike it with his rays,
nor did rain pass clean through;

and he, face to face, out of the lair,
having bristled well his crest, and fire with his eyes glaring,
stood then near them;

and he, then, first of all, Odysseus,
rushed on, having raised a long spear in his stout hand,
eager to wound;

At him then his father and lady mother
rejoiced, as he came home, and asked about each thing,
the scar, what he had suffered;

if under me, at least, a god subdues the noble suitors,
not even you, being a nurse, will I hold off from, whenever other
maidservants in my halls I kill, women.”
